WEBVTT

00:00:00.126 --> 00:00:03.801
On a video's Select page, Export a frame shows every frame from the playhead.

00:00:03.801 --> 00:00:09.487
Step with Next frame to find the sharpest picture.

00:00:09.487 --> 00:00:15.749
Export this frame as a PNG at its original size. This demo saves to a prepared folder.

00:00:15.749 --> 00:00:22.491
The frame is saved as a picture. Show in folder opens its location.
